DragonsDen_Cave4_Text_DragonTamerAirat_1::
	.string "We are the three DRAGON MASTERS.\p"
	.string "If you are strong enough to\n"
	.string "defeat us we will reward you with\l"
	.string "a prize.\p"
	.string "Engarde!$"

DragonsDen_Cave4_Text_DragonTamerAiratDefeat::
	.string "I concede defeat...$"

DragonsDen_Cave4_Text_DragonTamerAiratVictory::
	.string "You were easily defeated...$"

DragonsDen_Cave4_Text_DragonTamerAirat_2::
	.string "You defeated all of us...\n"
	.string "Very impressive!\p"
	.string "As we promised here’s your\n"
	.string "reward!$"

DragonsDen_Cave4_Text_DragonTamerAirat_3::
	.string "We wish you good luck in your\n"
	.string "journey…$"

DragonsDen_Cave4_Text_DragonTamerAirat_4::
	.string "We DRAGON MASTERS are to remain in\n"
	.string "the DRAGON’S DEN.\p"
	.string "We are awaiting for the return of\n"
	.string "the legendary DRAGON POKéMON...$"

DragonsDen_Cave4_Text_DragonTamerGon::
	.string "It was said that the legendary\n"
	.string "DRAGON POKéMON came to the\l"
	.string "DRAGON’S DEN sometimes.\p"
	.string "It used to roost at the top of the\n"
	.string "mountain.$"

DragonsDen_Cave4_Text_DragonTamerBravo::
	.string "The legendary DRAGON POKéMON used\n"
	.string "to enjoy the company of other\l"
	.string "DRAGON POKéMON.\p"
	.string "It was said that LANCE’S Grandfather\n"
	.string "came with certain DRAGON POKéMON\l"
	.string "and the legendary DRAGON POKéMON\l"
	.string "showed its presence to him...$"

DragonsDen_Cave4_Text_ItemDragonFang_1::
	.string "CLAIR: All right.\n"
	.string "I recognize your true power.\l"
	.string "This BADGE is yours.\p"
	.string "{FONT 0x02}{PLAYER} received the RISINGBADGE!{PAUSE_MUSIC}{PLAY_BGM MUS_OBTAIN_BADGE}{PAUSE 0xFE}{PAUSE 0x56}{RESUME_MUSIC}$"

DragonsDen_Cave4_Text_ItemDragonFang_2::
	.string "RISINGBADGE will enable your\n"
	.string "POKéMON to use the move for\l"
	.string "climbing waterfalls.\p"
	.string "Also, all POKéMON will recognize you\n"
	.string "as a trainer and obey your every\l"
	.string "command without question.\p"
	.string "I also want you to have this TM.$"

DragonsDen_Cave4_Text_ItemDragonFang_3::
	.string "That contains DRAGONBREATH.\p"
	.string "No, it doesn’t have anything to\n"
	.string "do with my breath.\p"
	.string "Geez...\n"
	.string "If you don’t want it, you don’t\l"
	.string "have to take it.$"

DragonsDen_Cave4_Text_ItemDragonFang_4::
	.string "So, you’ve collected all the\n"
	.string "BADGES.\p"
	.string "Your destination is the POKéMON\n"
	.string "LEAGUE in INDIGO PLATEAU.\p"
	.string "Do you know how to get there?\p"
	.string "From here, go to NEW BARK TOWN.\p"
	.string "Then SURF east.\n"
	.string "The route there is very tough.\p"
	.string "Don’t you dare lose at the POKéMON\n"
	.string "LEAGUE!\p"
	.string "If you do, I’ll feel even worse\n"
	.string "about having lost to you!$"

DragonsDen_Cave4_Text_LaprasDoll::
	.string "The Path will be revealed only to\n"
	.string "DRAGON MASTERS.$"

DragonsDen_Cave4_Text_RsBrendan_1::
	.string "... What? {PLAYER}?\p"
	.string "...No,\n"
	.string "I won’t battle you now...\p"
	.string "My POKéMON aren’t ready to\n"
	.string "beat you.\p"
	.string "I can’t push them too hard now.\n"
	.string "I have to be disciplined to become\l"
	.string "the greatest POKéMON trainer...$"

DragonsDen_Cave4_Text_RsBrendan_2::
	.string "... Whew...\n"
	.string "Learn to stay out of my way...$"

DragonsDen_Cave4_Text_Sign::
	.string "DRAGON SHRINE\p"
	.string "A shrine honoring the dragon POKéMON\n"
	.string "said to have lived in DRAGON’S DEN.$"
